---
import SitePage from "../layouts/SitePage.astro";
import BrandPhoto from "../components/BrandPhoto.astro";
import handshake from "../assets/brand/handshake.webp";
---

<SitePage
  title={"Recruiting Services — RPO, Container, Contingent"}
  description={
    "Three ways to work with Golden Recruiting: RPO, container search, and contingent search. See how a search runs, step by step."
  }
  heading={"Ways to work with us"}
  intro={
    "Every company hires differently, so we offer three ways to engage. Not sure which fits? Tell us what you're hiring for and we'll recommend one, honestly."
  }
>
  <section
    aria-labelledby="recruitment"
    class="border-b border-line py-14 sm:py-20"
  >
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="recruitment" class="text-3xl leading-snug">
        Recruitment process outsourcing (RPO)
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">
        Your recruiting team, on call
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">
        We work as an extension of your team for ongoing or high-volume hiring.
        We handle sourcing, screening, and pipeline management under one
        program, so you're not starting from zero with each new role.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">
        Best for: Growing teams with several hires ahead.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section
    aria-labelledby="contingent"
    class="border-b border-line py-14 sm:py-20"
  >
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="contingent" class="text-3xl leading-snug">
        Contingent search
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">Pay when we place</p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">
        You pay a fee only when someone we introduced accepts your offer. It's a
        good fit for a single role, or for getting to know us before committing
        to more.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">
        Best for: One-off hires and first-time clients.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section
    aria-labelledby="container"
    class="border-b border-line py-14 sm:py-20"
  >
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="container" class="text-3xl leading-snug">
        Container search
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">
        Priority attention, shared commitment
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">
        A modest upfront fee reserves our dedicated time for your search and is
        credited toward the placement fee. You get the focus of a retained
        search without the full retainer.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">
        Best for: Roles that are urgent, senior, or hard to fill.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="compare" class="border-b border-line py-14">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="compare" class="text-3xl">
        Ways to work with us
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full min-w-[600px] text-left">
          <caption class="sr-only">Compare our recruiting services</caption>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col" class="p-4"></th>
              <th scope="col" class="p-4">
                RPO
              </th>
              <th scope="col" class="p-4">
                Container
              </th>
              <th scope="col" class="p-4">
                Contingent
              </th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-t border-line">
              <th scope="row" class="p-4">
                When you pay
              </th>
              <td class="p-4 text-ink-dim">Ongoing program fee</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-ink-dim">Part upfront, rest on hire</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-ink-dim">On hire only</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-t border-line">
              <th scope="row" class="p-4">
                Our commitment
              </th>
              <td class="p-4 text-ink-dim">Embedded with your team</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-ink-dim">Dedicated, priority search</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-ink-dim">Active search</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-t border-line">
              <th scope="row" class="p-4">
                Best for
              </th>
              <td class="p-4 text-ink-dim">Multiple or ongoing hires</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-ink-dim">Urgent or senior roles</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-ink-dim">Single roles</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="steps" class="border-b border-line py-14 sm:py-20">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="steps" class="text-3xl leading-snug">
        What to expect, step by step
      </h2>
      <ol class="mt-8 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
        <li class="border-t border-line pt-5">
          <p class="text-brand" aria-hidden="true">
            01
          </p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl">Intake call</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">
            We start with a real conversation about the role, the team, and what
            success looks like. A job description tells us the requirements. You
            tell us the rest. Then we go to the people: direct outreach,
            referrals, and our own network.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="border-t border-line pt-5">
          <p class="text-brand" aria-hidden="true">
            02
          </p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl">Review the short list</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">
            We interview each person against your brief, then walk you through
            the first profiles with our notes on why each one is there. Your
            reactions sharpen the search.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="border-t border-line pt-5">
          <p class="text-brand" aria-hidden="true">
            03
          </p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl">Interview and hire</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">
            You meet the people worth meeting. We help with the offer, the
            negotiation, and the nerves on both sides, and we stay in touch
            through the start date and beyond.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <BrandPhoto
        src={handshake}
        alt="Two professionals shaking hands in an office"
      />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="faq" class="border-b border-line py-14 sm:py-20">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="faq" class="text-3xl leading-snug">
        FAQ
      </h2>
      <details class="border-b border-line py-5">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium">
          How much does it cost?
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">
          It depends on how you engage us. Contingent searches are billed only
          on placement. Container searches include a smaller upfront fee
          credited toward the placement fee. RPO is a program fee. We'll walk
          you through exact terms on our first call.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details class="border-b border-line py-5">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium">
          How long does a search take?
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">
          It varies by role and seniority. We'll give you a realistic timeline
          before we start.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details class="border-b border-line py-5">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium">
          Do you only work in Charlotte?
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">
          No. We're based in Charlotte and run searches across the country, for
          on-site, hybrid, and remote roles.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details class="border-b border-line py-5">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium">
          Who will I be working with?
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">
          Bri, our founder. She runs your search and is your point of contact
          from the first call to the start date.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details class="border-b border-line py-5">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium">
          How many candidates will I see?
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">
          Usually a short list of people we've already interviewed. We'd rather
          send a few strong fits than a long list to sort through.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="start" class="border-b border-line py-14 sm:py-20">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="start" class="text-3xl leading-snug">
        Ready to talk through a role?
      </h2>
      <a class="btn mt-6" href="/contact">
        Start a search
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</SitePage>
